ion: June 2030\n📜 RERA Possession Timeline: June 2032\n\n📈 2030 Investment Perspective\n\nMalabar Hill is one of Mumbai’s most supply-constrained ultra-luxury markets.\n\nRedevelopment opportunities here are extremely rare, making projects like Runwal Malabar Hill highly valuable.\n\n⭐ Why This Project Stands Out\n• 👑 Only 14 Exclusive Residences\n• 📍 Prestigious Malabar Hill Address\n• 🌊 270° Arabian Sea Views\n• 🏗 Architecture by Broadway Malyan\n• 🏙 Rare South Mumbai Redevelopment Project\n• 💼 Designed for HNIs & UHNIs\n\n📝 Booking & Enquiry Process\nDuring Site Visit:\n\n1️⃣ Detailed Project Presentation\n2️⃣ Residence Pricing & Payment Plan Discussion\n3️⃣ Layout & Sea View Orientation\n4️⃣ Booking & Documentation Assistance\n⚠️ Limited inventory available. [...] # Runwal Malabar Hill Mumbai | Ultra Luxury Sea View Apartments | Price, Floor Plan & Amenities\n## PropertyCloud \n4850 subscribers\n5 likes\n\n### Description\n326 views\nPosted: 7 Mar 2026\nRunwal Malabar Hill Mumbai | Ultra Luxury Sea View Apartments | Price, Floor Plan & Amenities\n\n📥 Download Runwal Malabar Hill E-Brochure: \n📥 Request Site Visit & Latest Pricing Details: \n\n🟢 Key Moments in This Video 🟢\n\n⏱ 0:00 Intro\n⏱ 0:36 Project Introduction\n⏱ 1:20 Project Overview\n⏱ 1:48 Location & Connectivity\n⏱ 2:29 Amenities & Lifestyle\n⏱ 2:50 Configurations & Pricing\n⏱ 4:25 Booking Benefits\n⏱ 4:34 Outro\n\n🏙 Runwal Malabar Hill – Project Overview\n\n✨ Runwal Malabar Hill is an ultra-exclusive luxury residential development located in the prestigious neighbourhood of Walkeshwar, Malabar Hill, South Mumbai.","score":0.9324162788916577,"raw_content":null,"id":"47fbd8-02"},{"url":"https://sitesetu.app/rera/maharashtra/mumbai","title":"Mumbai RERA Project List: 171 Projects - SiteSetu","content":"AndheriResidential / Group HousingActive\n\nRERA No.\n\nP51800003921\n\nOn request — contact developer / RERA-registered sales officeMAULI OMKAR\n\n### MAULI OMKAR\n\nby MAULI SAI DEVELOPERS PVT LTD\n\nTRI