Active\n\nRERA No.\n\nP51800014105\n\nOn request — contact developer / RERA-registered sales officeLawns And Beyond - Phase 3, Omkar International District\n\n### Lawns And Beyond - Phase 3, Omkar International District\n\nby Omkar Ventures Pvt. Ltd.","score":0.9247634995519745,"raw_content":null,"id":"6290e0-03"},{"url":"https://propertybutler.in/insights/sambhav-primordial-house-malabar-hill-review-2026","title":"Sambhav Primordial House — Malabar Hill Building Review 2026: Price, Verdict and Who It's For | Property Butler","content":"## Frequently Asked Questions\n\nThe committed possession date is available on the RERA portal under registration P51900010963. Property Butler advises verifying this directly on maharera.mahaonline.gov.in rather than relying on marketing materials. Small developers on Malabar Hill have historically taken 12–24 months beyond the RERA date to complete projects — factor this into your decision if you need possession by a specific date. [...] The project’s RERA registration P51900010963 is verifiable on the Maharashtra RERA portal (maharera.mahaonline.gov.in). Property Butler advises all buyers to verify: (1) RERA-committed possession date; (2) current construction stage versus RERA milestone schedule; (3) whether the developer has drawn any funds from the RERA escrow account beyond permitted stages. Small boutique developers on Malabar Hill have a mixed track record on construction pace — a completed, OC-received unit is worth a significant premium over an under-construction unit from the same developer.\n\n## The 57.7% PSF Discount vs Aurum Girnar — What It Means [...] It does NOT make sense for buyers who: (1) need RERA-guaranteed possession certainty on a specific date; (2) require institutional developer brand for external validation (family approval, NRI family members who associate Malabar Hill with established developer names only); (3) are comparing it to RTM resale options at similar PSF — at ₹54,000/sqft, there are Malabar Hill resale options in society buildings that deliver immediate possession, no GST, and no construction timeline risk.\n\n## Due Diligence Checklist for Sambhav Primordial House Buyers\n\n## Frequently Asked Questions","score":0.923004494900206,"raw_content":null,"id":"cd1f56-04"},{"url":"https://runwalmalabar-hill.in","title":"Runwal Malabar Hill | Duplex at Mumbai","content":"## Runwal Malabar Hill Property Specification\n\n|  |\n\n| Designed by Broadway Malyan |\n| Armani Bronze Facade |\n| Grand double-height lobby |\n| Two basements + dedicated staff level (L1with separate service elevator access) |\n| 11 parking bays (approx. 2500 sq.ft) |\n| Double-height clubhouse (22 ft) |\n| 2500 sq.ft Sky Lounge with amenities overlooking the Arabian Sea |\n\n## Configuration & Price Of Runwal Malabar Hill\n\n| Type | Carpet Area (sq ft) | Price |\n --- \n|\n| Duplex Apartment | 5000 Sqft | Call for Price |\n\n## Runwal Malabar Hill Floor Plan\n\n## Runwal Malabar Hill Gallery\n\n### Elevation Images\n\nRunwal-Malabar-Hill-Banner-2\n\nRunwal-Malabar-Hill-Banner-2\n\nRunwal-Malabar-Hill-Banner-1\n\nRunwal-Malabar-Hill-Banner-1\n\nRunwal-Malabar-Hill-Actual-View\n\nRunwal-Malabar-Hill-Actual-View [...] Malabar Hill is well-connected to Worli, Nariman Point, Colaba, Bandra, Churchgate.\n\nRunwal Realty has many ongoing, upcoming & completed Projects Runwal Anthurium - Mulund, Runwal Mycity - Dombivli East, The Residence -  Nepean Sea Road, Runwal Elegante - Andheri West, The Reserve - Worli, Nirvana By - Parel.\n\nRunwal Malabar Hill _ Elevation Image\n\n## Runwal Malabar Hill Overview\n\nProject Name\n\nProject Name\n\nRunwal Malabar Hill\n\nLocation\n\nLocation\n\nMalabar Hill, Mumbai\n\nDeveloper Name\n\nDeveloper Name\n\nRunwal Realty\n\nTOTAL TOWERS\n\nTOTAL TOWERS\n\n1\n\nFLOORS\n\nFLOORS\n\nG + 34 Storey\n\nAPARTMENTS\n\nAPARTMENTS\n\nDuplex Apartment\n\nAREA\n\nAREA\n\n5000 Sqft\n\nPOSSESSION\n\nPOSSESSION\n\nUnder Construction\n\nRESEDENTIAL\n\nRESEDENTIAL\n\nProperty